    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ornus</span></b> , i, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the wild mountain-ash</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">steriles orni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 111</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 3, 27, 58</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 16,
				18, 30, § 73</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col.
				Arbor. 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 1,
			11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a lance</i> made
			of the wood of this tree: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vibrabilis ornus Achilli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 24, 108</span></i>
			.</div>
